'''Ascend the Tower of Saviors''' (強襲！神魔之塔, ''Kyōshū! Shinma no Tō'', '''Assault! Tower of Gods and Demons''') is a [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event|Tower of Saviors]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 13.3 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Ascend the Tower of Saviors contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Floors'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Floor can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]], and [[Catamin]]s. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Ascend the Tower of Saviors/Floors 1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Ascend the Tower of Saviors is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

